{
  "title": "Quietly Spicy Brazilian Challots Stew",
  "description": "A spicy and comforting Brazilian stew featuring challots and confit-tomato, perfect for a sick day, and egg-free friendly. This dish is a hearty and flavorful way to warm up on a chilly day.",
  "cuisine": "Brazilian",
